  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norte Grande Competitiveness Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Competitividad del Norte Grande</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Aumentar la competitividad de cadenas productivas ubicadas en las Provincias que integran el NOA-NEA argentino (regin Norte Grande de Argentina) a travs del establecimiento de un mecanismo institucional de apoyo al desarrollo competitivo de las mismas, que muestre incrementos verificables en la competitividad de las empresas participantes medido por aumentos en exportaciones, mejoramiento de la productividad, incremento de ventas a mercados dinmicos, etc. El propsito consiste en implementar un Programa que incluya componentes concursables de apoyo al desarrollo de cadenas productivas, con procedimientos eficientes y transparentes, que promueva el trabajo asociativo entre empresas, en general a travs de entidades promotoras presentes en los ncleos yo circuitos de actividad econmica de la regin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase productive chains competitiveness in the Provinces that are part of the Argentinean NOA-NEA (Norte Grande Region), through the establishment of an institutional mechanism which supports development of these productive chains showing verifiable increases in the competitiveness of the participating companies measured through increases on exports, productivity improvements, increases in dynamic market sales, etc. The purpose consists of implementing a Program that will include components which will support development, with efficient and transparent procedures, promoting associated work between companies, generally through promoter entities present in the nucleuses andor circuits of economic activity within the region.</narrative>
  </description>
